| Concept              | Description                                                         |
| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| SPA             | Single Page Application — loads once, dynamically updates           |
| MPA              | Multi Page Application — traditional websites, reload for each page |
| React             | A JavaScript library for building UI, mainly SPAs                   |
| Virtual DOM      | A lightweight copy of real DOM that React uses to optimize updates  |
| Create React App  | Boilerplate tool to quickly scaffold React apps                     |
| Pros of SPA      | Fast, seamless user experience, less server load                    |
| Cons of SPA       | SEO can be tricky, larger initial load                              |
